(6524968, 970708, 124815, '<td valign="top">it''s a good, funky picture. Normally I do not look much at pretty-kids-family album. We all have ours to share with friends and family. But this tells a good story and has a good title.</td>', 'it''s a good, funky picture. Normally I do not look much at pretty-kids-family album. We all have ours to share with friends and family. But this tells a good story and has a good title.', '2011-09-02 14:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524973, 970699, 124815, '<td valign="top">Creepy in not such an interesting way, at least for me. Sort of Halloween.  A lot of good work here though put to a lesser use.</td>', 'Creepy in not such an interesting way, at least for me. Sort of Halloween.  A lot of good work here though put to a lesser use.', '2011-09-02 14:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524977, 970732, 124815, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good work but IMO with a lot of technical flaws. I like the gemini idea, although if one is air one earth, one shall look up and not also down, just in opposite direction. The work on the cheeks is well done but looks odd and too visceral. The Rorschach image is a good idea here. I believe that you shall continue this idea again. the sitter is wonderful and the gaze worth a novel. 7</td>', 'Good idea, good work but IMO with a lot of technical flaws. I like the gemini idea, although if one is air one earth, one shall look up and not also down, just in opposite direction. The work on the cheeks is well done but looks odd and too visceral. The Rorschach image is a good idea here. I believe that you shall continue this idea again. the sitter is wonderful and the gaze worth a novel. 7', '2011-09-02 14:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524979, 970746, 124815, '<td valign="top">well, a high school journal page for sure. no mark</td>', 'well, a high school journal page for sure. no mark', '2011-09-02 14:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
