(6525009, 970192, 124815, '<td valign="top">Oh, very ambitious! Very, very well done! Most excellent. Well felt.<br/>One tiny comment ... the  girl in the aware position is fantastic, the one asleep makes me think that she''ll become a little princess, the nasty one, with a nasty sense of entitlement .... what a pity ... but that''s another story.<br/>10<br/>and one more thing, perhaps I don''t see well on my screen; what''s on the girl''s arm? Looks between hair and a skin disease</td>', 'Oh, very ambitious! Very, very well done! Most excellent. Well felt.One tiny comment ... the  girl in the aware position is fantastic, the one asleep makes me think that she''ll become a little princess, the nasty one, with a nasty sense of entitlement .... what a pity ... but that''s another story.10and one more thing, perhaps I don''t see well on my screen; what''s on the girl''s arm? Looks between hair and a skin disease', '2011-09-02 14:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525010, 970692, 83313, '<td valign="top">Scary looking. I think it''s quite effective.</td>', 'Scary looking. I think it''s quite effective.', '2011-09-02 14:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525016, 970086, 124815, '<td valign="top">I cannot take my eyes from the elegance given by the visual intersection  of the lines of the frame of the painting in the background with the line of the seat back! This would have been a splendid picture for "In the style of Librodo" and it sure is a splendid picture on its own. 10</td>', 'I cannot take my eyes from the elegance given by the visual intersection  of the lines of the frame of the painting in the background with the line of the seat back! This would have been a splendid picture for "In the style of Librodo" and it sure is a splendid picture on its own. 10', '2011-09-02 14:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525017, 970680, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit familiar. I think this may be Mrs. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27617" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Patrick_R</a>. I''ll bet you like getting up in the morning.</td>', 'Looks a bit familiar. I think this may be Mrs.  Patrick_R. I''ll bet you like getting up in the morning.', '2011-09-02 14:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525024, 970568, 83313, '<td valign="top">I need to finish reading your blog about your bike tour, but I want to start at the beginning. What an awesome trip! I am curious what camera gear you have taken on your trip, since almost everything on the blog appears to be wideangle shots.</td>', 'I need to finish reading your blog about your bike tour, but I want to start at the beginning. What an awesome trip! I am curious what camera gear you have taken on your trip, since almost everything on the blog appears to be wideangle shots.', '2011-09-02 14:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525032, 970152, 124815, '<td valign="top">was the skin disease applied all over necessary here? I personally do not think so (unless it was a piece for a medical journal). The effect just at the eyes would have been enough and convey the emotion, now it''s uniform and mechanical and lost the effect.  The portrait would have been great.</td>', 'was the skin disease applied all over necessary here? I personally do not think so (unless it was a piece for a medical journal). The effect just at the eyes would have been enough and convey the emotion, now it''s uniform and mechanical and lost the effect.  The portrait would have been great.', '2011-09-02 15:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525033, 970704, 124815, '<td valign="top">A bit formal.</td>', 'A bit formal.', '2011-09-02 15:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
