(6525041, 970601, 124815, '<td valign="top">This idea was used many times and the result ends up looking a bit odd. There is no interest in the shape of the removed piece. An unfortunate choice of overlapping.</td>', 'This idea was used many times and the result ends up looking a bit odd. There is no interest in the shape of the removed piece. An unfortunate choice of overlapping.', '2011-09-02 15:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525046, 969719, 124815, '<td valign="top">well, we go back to the same topic: a picture of a picture of a picture. I have nothing against it IF the photo brings something new, be it a new light, a new way of looking at the painting ... not adding a moustache though! That was also done. <br/>No marks here</td>', 'well, we go back to the same topic: a picture of a picture of a picture. I have nothing against it IF the photo brings something new, be it a new light, a new way of looking at the painting ... not adding a moustache though! That was also done. No marks here', '2011-09-02 15:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525048, 970324, 124815, '<td valign="top">Not bad! It does have the softness, the bubbliness ... there are some uncanny things though. The crop of the bottom lip seems random, the temples, too close "shave" on the sitter''s left cheek. But refreshing.</td>', 'Not bad! It does have the softness, the bubbliness ... there are some uncanny things though. The crop of the bottom lip seems random, the temples, too close "shave" on the sitter''s left cheek. But refreshing.', '2011-09-02 15:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525052, 970626, 124815, '<td valign="top">Certainly interesting shot, sort of Italian cinema. So nice when there is a meaning and not just a portrait or a nude. Or a sunset. Yes, there is a film shot here, very well done.<br/>bump to 9</td>', 'Certainly interesting shot, sort of Italian cinema. So nice when there is a meaning and not just a portrait or a nude. Or a sunset. Yes, there is a film shot here, very well done.bump to 9', '2011-09-02 15:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
