(6525229, 970746, 16106, '<td valign="top">Just too much for me. Had you used the center panel as a tryptic it would have been great, but the additions on the over soft B&amp;Ws and the rosepetals... It just overwhelms the 800 pixel space. It is like one of those row boat crossing the river puzzles, one B&amp;W and the roses, or the tryptic, or the two B&amp;Ws all get across the river. All in one trip swamps the little boat.</td>', 'Just too much for me. Had you used the center panel as a tryptic it would have been great, but the additions on the over soft B&Ws and the rosepetals... It just overwhelms the 800 pixel space. It is like one of those row boat crossing the river puzzles, one B&W and the roses, or the tryptic, or the two B&Ws all get across the river. All in one trip swamps the little boat.', '2011-09-02 17:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
