(6525455, 970300, 124815, '<td valign="top">Hmm, looks like a portrait of a strong man, at least on my screen. Good powerful gaze but the grain twists the nose into a funny shape from the <strike>eyelashes</strike> eyebrows down. So, grain wins and the beauty of the picture fades.</td>', 'Hmm, looks like a portrait of a strong man, at least on my screen. Good powerful gaze but the grain twists the nose into a funny shape from the eyelashes eyebrows down. So, grain wins and the beauty of the picture fades.', '2011-09-02 19:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
