(6525549, 970086, 27108, '<td valign="top">Nice Portrait, background aswell. But they are things on the picture that I dont like quite that much... one of the beeing the massive stones/decoration on the clothing, bringing my eyes at her lower body instead to at her eyes, where the focus should be at. Then, there is that "Expert Editing", that I cant see anywhere on the pic. Though I see a bit exgerated plasticly effect on her face.<br/> <br/>pd. The shot has potential on its own (beside the challenge), but the detail that kills me the most is the white zip line on the chair.. maybe some cloning, could have fixed it?</td>', 'Nice Portrait, background aswell. But they are things on the picture that I dont like quite that much... one of the beeing the massive stones/decoration on the clothing, bringing my eyes at her lower body instead to at her eyes, where the focus should be at. Then, there is that "Expert Editing", that I cant see anywhere on the pic. Though I see a bit exgerated plasticly effect on her face. pd. The shot has potential on its own (beside the challenge), but the detail that kills me the most is the white zip line on the chair.. maybe some cloning, could have fixed it?', '2011-09-02 20:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525551, 970708, 27108, '<td valign="top">like that greenish tone, but the darker spot at her right (our left) at mouth level is a bit to much. Then the girl is quite back all this green and brushing, at the same time as her eyes arent focused either. and those white spots at her left (our right), one at center and the other at the higher corner, do get too much attention and it shouldnt.<br/> <br/>btw. looks like she''s watching right at an old security camera, and we are watching it in an old greenish monitor! :)</td>', 'like that greenish tone, but the darker spot at her right (our left) at mouth level is a bit to much. Then the girl is quite back all this green and brushing, at the same time as her eyes arent focused either. and those white spots at her left (our right), one at center and the other at the higher corner, do get too much attention and it shouldnt. btw. looks like she''s watching right at an old security camera, and we are watching it in an old greenish monitor! :)', '2011-09-02 20:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525554, 970521, 27108, '<td valign="top">As the title says... "Natural", cant see there is "Expert Editing" here. I guess there is some cloning on face, aswell as glamourizing (or call it what ever it is called).<br/> <br/>The model is astonishing beautiful! I would love having her as a neighbour, so I could stop by to ask for sugar or other things (excuses) ;)</td>', 'As the title says... "Natural", cant see there is "Expert Editing" here. I guess there is some cloning on face, aswell as glamourizing (or call it what ever it is called). The model is astonishing beautiful! I would love having her as a neighbour, so I could stop by to ask for sugar or other things (excuses) ;)', '2011-09-02 20:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
