(6525729, 970704, 27108, '<td valign="top">hmm.. almost!  Kind of to much smoke, and the attention goes to those light smoke areas.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'hmm.. almost!  Kind of to much smoke, and the attention goes to those light smoke areas. Good luck in the challenge!', '2011-09-02 22:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525730, 970364, 68947, '<td valign="top">You have done an excellent job with the expert editing capabilities in my opinion.  I''m not sure quite what it is but, if I had to give a "critical comment" as help, I think that I''d say that a closer crop to her face and perhaps, a bit of photoshopping out the redness of her skin tones (chin and cheeks) might have made this one a bit more polished.  Still...liking this shot.  Very creative.</td>', 'You have done an excellent job with the expert editing capabilities in my opinion.  I''m not sure quite what it is but, if I had to give a "critical comment" as help, I think that I''d say that a closer crop to her face and perhaps, a bit of photoshopping out the redness of her skin tones (chin and cheeks) might have made this one a bit more polished.  Still...liking this shot.  Very creative.', '2011-09-02 22:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525731, 970015, 27108, '<td valign="top">hmm.. good looking model!, and what an amazing tattoo! is this real? or is it fake? (expert editing?)<br/> <br/>If its real, could you please talk to her, to make some great photos of the entire tattoo? (pics from back, from the sides, and front!  why?.. cause Im thinking of tattooing me, and this could be my something for me! ;)  hehe, always liked te chinese/japanese style, and love those Dragons!<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'hmm.. good looking model!, and what an amazing tattoo! is this real? or is it fake? (expert editing?) If its real, could you please talk to her, to make some great photos of the entire tattoo? (pics from back, from the sides, and front!  why?.. cause Im thinking of tattooing me, and this could be my something for me! ;)  hehe, always liked te chinese/japanese style, and love those Dragons! Good luck in the challenge.', '2011-09-02 22:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525739, 970664, 68947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl, nice soft focus, captures her essence very well.  If I''m offering some constructive comments, I''d have to say that given that this was an expert editing challenge, the background might have been changed to something without frames behind your model and perhaps, a bit of a vignette appearance around her to emphasize her beauty. :)  This way, against the others that are expert edited...it kind of has more of a "snapshot" type of look and feel to it.  Still a beautiful model. :)</td>', 'Beautiful girl, nice soft focus, captures her essence very well.  If I''m offering some constructive comments, I''d have to say that given that this was an expert editing challenge, the background might have been changed to something without frames behind your model and perhaps, a bit of a vignette appearance around her to emphasize her beauty. :)  This way, against the others that are expert edited...it kind of has more of a "snapshot" type of look and feel to it.  Still a beautiful model. :)', '2011-09-02 23:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525743, 969719, 68947, '<td valign="top">What a novel idea to capture for this challenge.  :)</td>', 'What a novel idea to capture for this challenge.  :)', '2011-09-02 23:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525744, 970086, 68947, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!</td>', 'Beautifully done!', '2011-09-02 23:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525747, 970747, 68947, '<td valign="top">I was going to quickly switch to the next at first glance as it had more of a "snapshot look" but, upon a second glance...saw the mini-me on the desk and laughed!  Really cute!! 8</td>', 'I was going to quickly switch to the next at first glance as it had more of a "snapshot look" but, upon a second glance...saw the mini-me on the desk and laughed!  Really cute!! 8', '2011-09-02 23:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525748, 970390, 68947, '<td valign="top">FABULOUS!!!  Very artsy and love the title as it suits so well.  Lovely work!!!</td>', 'FABULOUS!!!  Very artsy and love the title as it suits so well.  Lovely work!!!', '2011-09-02 23:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
