(6525754, 970613, 68947, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful job you''ve done on this one.  Really captures an essence.  I wish that they''d do more expert editing challenges to see this type of work. :)</td>', 'What a wonderful job you''ve done on this one.  Really captures an essence.  I wish that they''d do more expert editing challenges to see this type of work. :)', '2011-09-02 23:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
