(6532333, 970680, 49520, '<td valign="top">That''s one beautiful model! Very nice composition, subject pose, and colors!</td>', 'That''s one beautiful model! Very nice composition, subject pose, and colors!', '2011-09-07 22:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532343, 969786, 49520, '<td valign="top">Everything is great in this picture (colors, make-up, concept), except for one thing... The composition feels off.<br/> <br/>If the intention of the photo was to highlight the interaction between the woman and the butterfly, the composition does it even less justice.<br/> <br/>My eyes are drawn towards the bottom right where the strong and contrasting pink color is.<br/> <br/>Still, the lighting, contrast, and exposure is spot on!</td>', 'Everything is great in this picture (colors, make-up, concept), except for one thing... The composition feels off. If the intention of the photo was to highlight the interaction between the woman and the butterfly, the composition does it even less justice. My eyes are drawn towards the bottom right where the strong and contrasting pink color is. Still, the lighting, contrast, and exposure is spot on!', '2011-09-07 22:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532348, 970086, 49520, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors! The only thing distracting to my eyes, is the white of the chair, which breaks the warm feel.<br/> <br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'Wonderful colors! The only thing distracting to my eyes, is the white of the chair, which breaks the warm feel. Congratulations!', '2011-09-07 22:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532356, 970601, 49520, '<td valign="top">There''s no doubt in my mind that this is my favourite!<br/> <br/>The reason I''m not giving it a ten...? The floating puzzle piece could have a smoother and more solid cutout like the other pieces.<br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'There''s no doubt in my mind that this is my favourite! The reason I''m not giving it a ten...? The floating puzzle piece could have a smoother and more solid cutout like the other pieces. Great job!', '2011-09-07 22:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
