(6532745, 970599, 111504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft and dreamy</td>', 'Beautiful soft and dreamy', '2011-09-08 01:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532812, 970086, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think this is the only real portrait in the challenge. Some are good but mostly ''head'' shots: like you would do in school. Most are just photos of females. Some have really good ''expert'' editing. Most are ''snaphots'': but nothing against ''snapshots''! This, this is a portrait and should be the winner...in my opinion.</td>', 'I think this is the only real portrait in the challenge. Some are good but mostly ''head'' shots: like you would do in school. Most are just photos of females. Some have really good ''expert'' editing. Most are ''snaphots'': but nothing against ''snapshots''! This, this is a portrait and should be the winner...in my opinion.', '2011-09-08 01:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
