(6532940, 969719, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great pic, but not sure how to feel about you taking a pic of a drawing  hope it''s legal.</td>', 'Great pic, but not sure how to feel about you taking a pic of a drawing  hope it''s legal.', '2011-09-08 02:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6532950, 970300, 61396, '<td valign="top">Day1: You made me go back quite a bit to fully grasp what you present here<br/>Day2: she looks a bit sad today, or maybe just discontent<br/>Day3: is she wearing a singlet?<br/>Day4: sometimes I think she''s looking at me, but most of the time I think she''s too tired to see<br/>Day5: I want to know more about the parts that were cropped, but I also think I''m better off as it is<br/>Day6: her look today makes feel guilty of something. I wonder what does she know.</td>', 'Day1: You made me go back quite a bit to fully grasp what you present hereDay2: she looks a bit sad today, or maybe just discontentDay3: is she wearing a singlet?Day4: sometimes I think she''s looking at me, but most of the time I think she''s too tired to seeDay5: I want to know more about the parts that were cropped, but I also think I''m better off as it isDay6: her look today makes feel guilty of something. I wonder what does she know.', '2011-09-08 03:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
