(6533690, 970685, 75585, '<td valign="top">I really like this; the one thing I would change would be to soften the line at the top where her forehead/head and the vignetting (for lack of a better word) are.  I also would get rid of the funky lines in the bottom left and right where it is peachy colored and there is some dark lines.  Otherwise I absolutely LOVE this photo very cool (on so many levels :-)</td>', 'I really like this; the one thing I would change would be to soften the line at the top where her forehead/head and the vignetting (for lack of a better word) are.  I also would get rid of the funky lines in the bottom left and right where it is peachy colored and there is some dark lines.  Otherwise I absolutely LOVE this photo very cool (on so many levels :-)', '2011-09-08 20:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
