(6534307, 970521, 27108, '<td valign="top">Congrats on Brown Ribbon!..<br/> <br/>(I think this photo would be better in a "Advanced Editing" challenge instead, cause I associate the "Expert Editing" as something more, than just a nice pic)... don''t get me wrong, your photo is very sweet. :)<br/> <br/>"take a look at the Male Portrait competition (Expert Editing aswell), and see those winners!.. in fact I gave 10''s to nr.1 and nr.2, while a 9 to nr. 3!", in the female portrait  challenge I gave 10''s to nr. 8 and nr. 18, as they fitted better the "expert editing")<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-09-09 00:27:26.</i></td>', 'Congrats on Brown Ribbon!.. (I think this photo would be better in a "Advanced Editing" challenge instead, cause I associate the "Expert Editing" as something more, than just a nice pic)... don''t get me wrong, your photo is very sweet. :) "take a look at the Male Portrait competition (Expert Editing aswell), and see those winners!.. in fact I gave 10''s to nr.1 and nr.2, while a 9 to nr. 3!", in the female portrait  challenge I gave 10''s to nr. 8 and nr. 18, as they fitted better the "expert editing")', '2011-09-09 01:19:59.000000', '2011-09-09 01:27:26.000000', 0),
