(6534382, 970699, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the hand, but the smoke/face is fascinating.<br/>At first glance, I really only saw the models left side (on our right). It took a few more moments before the smoke on the left actually "turned into" the right side of her face.<br/> <br/>Like on of those optical illusion tricks, but nice and subtle. Love it!<br/>Please show us how you did the blending of smoke and face.</td>', 'I don''t care for the hand, but the smoke/face is fascinating.At first glance, I really only saw the models left side (on our right). It took a few more moments before the smoke on the left actually "turned into" the right side of her face. Like on of those optical illusion tricks, but nice and subtle. Love it!Please show us how you did the blending of smoke and face.', '2011-09-09 01:36:20.000000', NULL, 0),
