(6534500, 970086, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon for this very lovely portrait. You certainly did an expert job of the expert editing. I would never have guessed that this wasn''t a straight shot of what it appears to be. I''m glad you played it safe regarding possible DQ and you didn''t lose a thing in the final quality of the image - I actually like this version better.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon for this very lovely portrait. You certainly did an expert job of the expert editing. I would never have guessed that this wasn''t a straight shot of what it appears to be. I''m glad you played it safe regarding possible DQ and you didn''t lose a thing in the final quality of the image - I actually like this version better.', '2011-09-09 02:52:03.000000', NULL, 0),
